        "_id": "69c4fd1abd7eb2628ba3f7a2",
        "title": "Welcome to Our Announcements Se",
        "slug": "welcome-to-our-announcements-se",
        "content": "\n        <p>This is a dummy announcement post created automatically for testing purposes in Acroxa CMS.</p>\n        <p>It demonstrates the full createPost functionality with Mongoose models.</p>\n       \n        <h2>Key Features Tested</h2>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Author as real ObjectId (from logged-in user)</li>\n          <li>Categories as real ObjectId array</li>\n          <li>SEO fields and Open Graph tags</li>\n          <li>Reading time calculation (via pre-save hook)</li>\n          <li>Published status with current date</li>\n        </ul>\n      ",
        "excerpt": "This is a test announcement post created automatically via JavaScript for Acroxa CMS.",
